# Deposit Flow

See [08-execution-flows.md](../08-execution-flows.md).

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant V as RobinVault
    participant I as INDEX ERC20

    User->>V: deposit(assets, receiver)
    Note over V: nonReentrant
    V->>V: maxDeposit check
    V->>V: previewDeposit → shares
    V->>I: transferFrom(User, Vault, assets)
    V->>V: mint(receiver, shares)
    V->>V: _updateEligibilityTracking()
    V-->>User: shares
```
